<html lang="gu">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Gujarati Mitra AI – ગુજરાતી મિત્ર</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+Gujarati:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#fff8ef;--card:#fff;--ink:#2b2118;--mut:#7a6a5a;--pri:#d9480f;--pri2:#fff0e6;--line:#f0dfcc;--ok:#e6f6e9;--okb:#2f9e44;--mk:#ffe8a3;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#1b1511;--card:#271e18;--ink:#f6ece2;--mut:#b9a999;--pri:#ff8a4c;--pri2:#3a2a20;--line:#3d2f25;--ok:#1d3223;--okb:#69db7c;--mk:#6b5513}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#1b1511;--card:#271e18;--ink:#f6ece2;--mut:#b9a999;--pri:#ff8a4c;--pri2:#3a2a20;--line:#3d2f25;--ok:#1d3223;--okb:#69db7c;--mk:#6b5513}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Noto Sans Gujarati",system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.7}
.wrap{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px}
h1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:.2em 0}h2{font-size:1.1rem;margin:0 0 .5em}
.sub{color:var(--mut);margin:0 0 12px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:14px;margin:12px 0}
textarea,input,select{width:100%;font:inherit;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px}
textarea{min-height:150px;resize:vertical}
textarea:focus,input:focus,select:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--pri)}
.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
button{font:inherit;font-weight:600;border:2px solid var(--pri);background:var(--pri2);color:var(--pri);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;cursor:pointer;flex:1 1 150px;min-height:48px}
button.main{background:var(--pri);color:#fff}
button:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.grid{display:grid;gap:12px;grid-template-columns:1fr}
@media(min-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.box{border-radius:12px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);white-space:pre-wrap;min-height:70px;word-break:break-word}
.box.new{background:var(--ok);border-color:var(--okb)}
mark{background:var(--mk);color:inherit;border-radius:4px;padding:0 2px}
.lbl{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--mut);margin-bottom:4px}
ul{padding-left:1.2em;margin:.3em 0}
.note{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--mut)}
.sl{padding:10px 12px;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:12px;margin:6px 0;display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.sl button{flex:0 0 auto;min-height:36px;padding:4px 10px}
details summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
.tc{padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
.pass{color:var(--okb)}.fail{color:#e03131}
label.lb{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;margin:10px 0 4px}
.hint{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--mut);margin:4px 0 8px}
.warn{background:var(--pri2);border-left:4px solid var(--pri);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:.88rem;margin:8px 0}
.road{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:.4em 0}.road li{padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
.about{max-width:760px;margin:8px auto 24px;padding:14px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:center;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--mut)}
.about b{color:var(--ink)}
.tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--pri2);color:var(--pri);border-radius:99px;padding:0 10px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1><span id="appName">Gujarati Mitra AI</span> <span class="tag">Prototype</span></h1>
  <p class="sub" id="tagline">ગુજરાતી લખાણ, હવે વધુ શુદ્ધ અને સરળ!</p>
  <p class="hint" style="margin-top:-6px">🧪 Demo: નિયમ-આધારિત (rule-based) એન્જિન · કોઈ AI model જોડાયેલું નથી · No AI model connected</p>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>🎯 હેતુ અને મોડ પસંદ કરો · Choose purpose &amp; mode</h2>
    <p class="hint">૧. હેતુ પસંદ કરો · ૨. મોડ પસંદ કરો · ૩. લખાણ લખી ‘શરૂ કરો’ દબાવો (1. Pick purpose, 2. Pick mode, 3. Type text and press Start)</p>
    <label class="lb" for="cat">હેતુ · Purpose</label>
    <select id="cat" onchange="onCat()"></select>
    <div class="hint" id="catHelp"></div>
    <input id="otherBox" placeholder="તમારો હેતુ લખો (Describe your purpose)" hidden>
    <div class="warn" id="catWarn" hidden></div>
    <label class="lb" for="wmode">લખાણ મોડ · Writing mode</label>
    <select id="wmode" onchange="onMode()"></select>
    <div class="hint" id="modeHelp"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2 id="inpTitle">✍️ તમારું લખાણ લખો · Enter your text</h2>
    <textarea id="inp" placeholder="અહીં ગુજરાતી લખાણ લખો… (Type or paste Gujarati here)"></textarea>
    <div class="row"><button class="main" onclick="go(document.getElementById('wmode').value)">▶ શરૂ કરો · Start</button></div>
    <p class="hint" style="margin-top:12px">ઝડપી બટન · Quick buttons</p>
    <div class="row">
      <button class="main" onclick="run('proof')">✅ Proofread Text</button>
      <button class="main" onclick="run('improve')">✨ Improve Writing</button>
      <button class="main" onclick="run('simple')">🌱 Simple Gujarati</button>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <button onclick="catSample()">Sample: this purpose</button>
      <button onclick="sample('para')">Sample: લખાણ</button>
      <button onclick="sample('banner')">Sample: Banner</button>
      <button onclick="clearAll()">Clear</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="warn" id="askBox" hidden></div>

  <div id="out" class="card" hidden>
    <h2 id="mode"></h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div><div class="lbl">મૂળ લખાણ · Original</div><div class="box" id="orig"></div></div>
      <div><div class="lbl">સુધારેલું લખાણ · Result</div><div class="box new" id="res"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="row"><button class="main" id="cp" onclick="copyRes()">📋 Copy Result</button></div>
    <p class="note">ℹ️ Rule-based demo: આ સાચું AI proofreading નથી. Only fixed hand-written rules were used.</p>
    <h2 style="margin-top:14px">💡 સુધારાની સમજ · What changed</h2>
    <ul id="why"></ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>📣 સ્લોગન બનાવો · Slogan &amp; Ad Generator</h2>
    <input id="brand" placeholder="નામ લખો, જેમ કે: સ્વાદ સ્ટોર" value="સ્વાદ સ્ટોર">
